<% const format=n=>Number(n).toLocaleString('en-US'),interval=locals.billingInterval==='annual'?'annual':'monthly',compared=offer.comparison(plans),usage=new Set(['agent_documents','ai_work_credits','incoming_emails','emails_sent','connected_operations','api_requests']),packLabel=category=>({ai_work_credits:'AI Work Credits',incoming_emails:'incoming emails',emails_sent:'outgoing recipients',connected_operations:'Connected Operations'}[category]||category),allowanceNumber=(plan,a)=>plan.sales_only?'Agreed limit':a.units==null?(a.meter==='locations'&&plan.id==='pro'?'Unlimited':'Contact support'):a.meter==='storage_bytes'?format(a.units/1e9)+' GB':format(a.units),allowanceLabel=a=>(a.label||a.meter).replace(/ per month$/i,'')+(usage.has(a.meter)?' / month':''); %>
<div class="pro-pricing">
<section class="pricing-intro"><div><p class="pub-kicker">Simple plans. Clear responsibilities.</p><h1>Know what StockChief handles for you</h1><p>See what each plan can do without training, what needs a rule, and what comes to you for approval.</p><a class="pricing-compare-link" href="#compare-agent-plans">Compare the plans ↓</a></div><nav aria-label="Billing interval"><a class="pub-btn" href="/pricing?interval=monthly" <%- interval==='monthly'?'aria-current="page"':'' %>>Monthly</a><a class="pub-btn" href="/pricing?interval=annual" <%- interval==='annual'?'aria-current="page"':'' %>>Annual billing</a></nav></section>
<% const chosenPlan=compared.find(plan=>planNavigation.state(plan,{account:locals.account,subscription:currentSubscription,selection:locals.planSelection,interval,checkoutOpen}).kind==='selected');if(chosenPlan){ %><p class="pub-notice" data-selected-plan-notice><%= chosenPlan.name %> is selected. <a href="<%= planNavigation.destination(chosenPlan,{account:locals.account,subscription:currentSubscription,interval,checkoutOpen}) %>">Continue with <%= chosenPlan.name %></a>. A selection does not activate a subscription.</p><% } %>
<% if(!checkoutOpen){ %><p class="pub-notice">Plan changes are paused right now. Please <a href="/support?topic=billing">contact support</a>. No payment will be taken.</p><% } %>
<% if(checkoutCancelled){ %><p class="pub-notice">Checkout was cancelled. No subscription was activated.</p><% } %>
<aside class="pricing-start"><strong>Starts in Watch only for 14 days.</strong><span>StockChief looks, answers and alerts before you give it authority. After that, you choose the mode for each job. “No training needed” means it understands the job already; connections, permissions and your limits still apply.</span></aside>
<section class="plan-ladder plan-comparison" aria-label="StockChief plans">
<% for(const plan of compared){const team=plan.allowances.find(a=>a.meter==='members'),price=interval==='annual'?plan.annual_amount_minor:plan.monthly_amount_minor; %>
<article class="plan-card" id="<%= plan.id %>" data-plan="<%= plan.id %>" data-monthly-minor="<%= plan.monthly_amount_minor??'' %>" data-annual-minor="<%= plan.annual_amount_minor??'' %>" data-offer-version="<%= plan.active_plan_version_id||'' %>">
<header><h2><%= plan.name %></h2></header>
<p class="plan-promise"><%= plan.sales_only?'Capacity and service agreed for your business.':team?.units!=null?'For a team of up to '+format(team.units)+' people.':'Room for your business to grow.' %></p>
<div class="plan-price"><% if(plan.sales_only||price==null){ %><strong>Agreed pricing</strong><small>Tell us what your business needs</small><% }else{ %><strong>$<%= format(Number(price)/100) %></strong><span>/<%= interval==='annual'?'year':'month' %></span><small data-price-note><%= interval==='annual'?'Annual charge, paid yearly':'Billed monthly' %></small><% } %></div>
<div class="plan-card__action"><% const action=planNavigation.state(plan,{account:locals.account,subscription:currentSubscription,selection:locals.planSelection,interval,checkoutOpen});if(action.disabled){ %><button class="pub-btn" type="button" disabled aria-disabled="true" data-plan-state="<%= action.kind %>"><%= action.label %></button><% }else{ %><a class="pub-btn" data-plan-link data-plan="<%= plan.id %>" href="<%= action.href %>"><%= action.label %></a><% } %></div>
<div class="plan-default" data-plan-default><h3>Without training</h3><p><%= agentPlans.plans[plan.id].defaultDescription %></p><a href="#plan-details-<%= plan.id %>" data-open-plan="<%= plan.id %>" data-open-mode="alone">See the no-training duties →</a></div>
<dl class="plan-quick-facts"><% for(const meter of ['products','locations','ai_work_credits']){const a=plan.allowances.find(a=>a.meter===meter);if(a){ %><div><dt><%= meter==='products'?'Products':meter==='locations'?'Sites per inventory':'AI credits / month' %></dt><dd><%= allowanceNumber(plan,a) %></dd></div><% }} %></dl>
<a class="plan-details-link" href="#plan-details-<%= plan.id %>" data-open-plan="<%= plan.id %>">Everything in <%= plan.name %> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
<details class="plan-limits"><summary>All limits &amp; allowances</summary><ul class="plan-allowances"><% for(const a of plan.allowances){const number=allowanceNumber(plan,a); %><li data-allowance="<%= a.meter %>" aria-label="<%= number+' '+allowanceLabel(a) %>"><span><%= allowanceLabel(a) %></span><strong><%= number %></strong></li><% } %></ul>
<% if(plan.configuration?.syncIntervalSeconds){ %><p>Connection checks from every <%= format(plan.configuration.syncIntervalSeconds/60) %> minute<%= plan.configuration.syncIntervalSeconds===60?'':'s' %>, subject to provider limits. Supported webhooks can arrive sooner.</p><% } %></details>
</article><% } %></section>
<div class="plan-footer"><span>14-day money-back guarantee</span><span>Unused included AI credits roll over one month</span><span>Usage alerts at 80%, 95% and 100%</span><span>Cancel anytime</span></div>
<%- include('agent-plan-comparison',{agentPlans,compared,format,interval,allowanceNumber,allowanceLabel}) %>
<%- include('plan-details',{agentPlans,compared,format,interval,allowanceNumber,allowanceLabel}) %>
<section class="pro-addons"><h2>Add more when you need it</h2><p class="pro-pricing-note">Monthly add-ons renew separately from your main plan. Each paid month of credits or documents is available for that add-on’s billing period.</p><div class="pro-addon-grid">
<% for(const pack of offerPacks){ %><article data-pack="<%= pack.id %>" data-pack-amount-minor="<%= pack.amount_minor %>"><strong><%= format(pack.units) %> <%= packLabel(pack.category) %></strong><span>$<%= format(Number(pack.amount_minor)/100) %></span></article><% } %>
<% for(const product of capacityProducts){ %><article><strong><%= product.label %></strong><% if(product.eligible_plans){ %><small><%= product.eligible_plans.map(p=>p==='enterprise'?'Custom':p[0].toUpperCase()+p.slice(1)).join(', ') %></small><% } %><span>$<%= format(Number(product.monthly_amount_minor)/100) %>/month</span><% if(product.awaiting_ai_review){ %><small>Awaiting usage cost review</small><% } else if(!product.stripe_price_id){ %><small>Billing setup pending</small><% } %></article><% } %></div></section>
<details class="pricing-explainer"><summary>How limits, usage and connections work</summary>
<p>A product can have many variants. Each active combination of up to three options counts as one SKU. Option names and values are yours to choose. One product with 10 variants and 100,000 units counts as 1 product and 10 SKUs. There is no plan-based cap on units of stock; quantity precision and exact-value safeguards apply.</p>
<p>Products, SKUs, people, inventories, connections, usage and storage are shared across the account. Warehouses, bins and custom roles are counted per inventory. Pending invitations occupy a person slot. Archived records retain their history and stored data. Row allowances apply per import; file-size and format limits also apply. Use CSV for the largest imports. Storage measures uncompressed business data and original attachments in decimal GB, excluding shared indexes, backups and service telemetry.</p>
<p>AI Work Credits pay for AI work. Incoming email processing counts unique accepted messages; outgoing sending counts recipients; Connected Operations count committed external business changes. Ordinary browsing, manual work, polling, API pagination and provider retries do not consume Connected Operations. An AI question costs 20 credits and AI mapping for an imported file costs 100 credits. Agent reports and alerts use no credits. Its email or external action uses the separately listed allowance. API requests and delivered webhooks have their own resource allowance, with no automatic overage billing.</p>
</details>
<p class="pro-pricing-note">Shipping postage and merchant card fees are billed by your connected provider. Customer payment connections are included on paid plans where production-supported and require provider setup. <a href="/integrations">Check each provider's supported operations and availability</a>. Custom ERP connections require agreed mappings and qualification; an integration category does not promise every vendor or operation.</p>
<p class="pro-pricing-note">Upgrades unlock after confirmed payment and start a new billing month. Eligible downgrades start at the end of your paid term. Existing records and accepted credit grants are preserved. A qualifying subscription refund cancels renewal, provides 30 days of read-only export access, then deletes workspace data. <a href="/terms">Read the subscription terms</a>.</p>
</div><script src="/plan-selection.js" defer></script>
